<title>USA: Norfolk Southern says revenue trend strong.</title>
<headline>Norfolk Southern says revenue trend strong.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norfolk Southern Corp marketing vice president Leslie Prillaman said revenue momentum from 1996 remained strong into the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The momentum remains strong going into the first quarter of 1997,&quot; Prillaman told an analysts meeting, which was monitored by telephone.</p>
</text>
